   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prepositions of place",
     "texto": [
      "**In** = in, inside. **Auf** = on top of. **Unter** = under. **Neben** = next to. **Hinter** = behind. **Vor** = in front of. **Zwischen** = between."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The dative: where something is",
     "texto": [
      "When these prepositions say **where something is**, the article goes in the **dative**: **der** and **das** change to **dem**; **die** changes to **der**.",
      "**der Tisch** → **auf dem Tisch** (on top of the table). **die Tasche** → **in der Tasche** (in the bag). **das Sofa** → **neben dem Sofa** (next to the sofa).",
      "Possessives change the same way: **in deiner Tasche** (in your bag).",
      "**In dem** contracts to **im**: **im Wohnzimmer**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
